3 Invoking 'crypto_tool'
************************

Synopsis:

     crypto_tool [options...]

'crypto_tool' performs AES-256-GCM authenticated encryption, digital
signing, signature verification, and asymmetric keypair generation.

3.1 'crypto_tool' Command-Line Options
======================================

'-action OP'
     Operation: 'encrypt' (default), 'decrypt', 'gen-key', 'sign',
     'verify', or 'gen-keypair'.

'-gen-key'
     Shortcut for '-action gen-key'; generates a 256-bit symmetric key.

'-in PATH'
     Input file path (use '-' or omit for 'stdin').

'-out PATH'
     Output file path (use '-' or omit for 'stdout'; secret outputs use
     mode '0600').

'-secure-key KEY, -key KEY'
     Passphrase or raw symmetric key (warns on 'stderr'; falls back to
     'FLOW_SECURE_KEY' or 'SECURE_KEY').

'-key-file PATH'
     Path to file containing the symmetric key/passphrase.

'-binary'
     Emit raw binary ciphertext or ASN.1 signature bytes instead of
     text-armored 'FLOWENC:v1:...' or 'FLOWSIG:v1:...' envelopes.

'-sig-type FORMAT'
     Signature format for '-action sign': 'openssl' (default; RSA,
     ECDSA, Ed25519), 'pgp' (OpenPGP), or 'pkcs7' (CMS / PKCS#7).

'-private-key PATH, -priv PATH'
     Private key file path (PEM or OpenPGP) for signing.

'-passphrase STR'
     Passphrase to decrypt password-protected private keys.

'-cert PATH'
     X.509 certificate path (PEM or DER).  Required for '-sig-type
     pkcs7' and supported for verification.

'-wrap'
     Bundle signature and payload into a unified 'FLOWSIGNED:v1:...'
     envelope.

'-signature PATH, -sig PATH'
     Detached signature path for '-action verify' (auto-checks
     '<in>.sig', '<in>.asc', '<in>.p7s' when omitted).

'-public-key PATH, -pub PATH'
     Public key path (PEM or OpenPGP) for verification.

'-ca-cert PATH'
     Root or intermediate CA certificate path for chain verification.

'-keyring PATH'
     OpenPGP armored public keyring path.

'-keypair-type TYPE'
     Algorithm for '-action gen-keypair': 'rsa' (default), 'ecdsa'
     (P-256), 'ed25519', or 'pgp' ('gpg', 'openpgp').

'-bits N'
     RSA modulus bit length (default '2048').

'-out-priv PATH'
     Output path for generated private key (mode '0600'; default
     'private_key.pem').

'-out-pub PATH'
     Output path for generated public key (mode '0644'; default
     'public_key.pem').

'-out-cert PATH'
     Optional output path for a 365-day self-signed X.509 certificate.

'-cn NAME'
     Common Name ('CN') or OpenPGP identity (default 'Flow Code
     Signer').

